.TH YOUTUIBE 1 "September 2026" "youTUIbe 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
youtuibe \- terminal media search, playback, and download manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B youtuibe
.RI [ OPTIONS ] " [URL ...]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
youTUIbe provides an interactive yt-dlp frontend with presets, a persistent
download queue, media search, artwork, and mpv playback controls.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --state " PATH"
Use a separate state file.
.TP
.BI "-o, --output " PATH
Set the download directory for this and future sessions.
.TP
.B --no-mouse
Disable terminal mouse capture.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show command help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Show the version.
.SH CONTROLS
Keys 1 through 7 switch tabs. Slash edits input. Question mark opens help.
On Search, p plays audio, P plays video, Space pauses, x stops,
Left/Right seek, minus/plus change volume, and m toggles mute.
Square brackets change video quality; braces change audio quality.
Enter opens the download builder; a queues a download. q saves and quits.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.local/share/youtuibe/state.json
stores settings and jobs. The legacy Tide state is imported on first launch.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yt-dlp (1),
.BR mpv (1),
.BR ffmpeg (1)
